      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تغمّل النَّبَاتُ</span></b>  <i>The plants,</i> or <i>herbage, became
accumulated, one,</i> or <i>one part, overlying another.</i>
(TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَمَلَ النَّبَاتُ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تغمّل</span> <i>He
became,</i> or <i>made himself, ample,</i> or <i>abundant,</i>
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوَسَّعَ</span>, (O, K,) <i>in wealth.</i> (O.)

